                <div class="heading col-xs-12 col-sm-8 col-md-8">
                    <p class='article__time'>May 21, 2020</p>
                    <h3 class='title'><em>U.S. Economic Outlook and Monetary Policy</em></h3>
                    <p class="speaker">
                        
                        
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                        Vice Chair Richard H. Clarida
                    </p> 
                    <p class='location'>At the New York Association for Business Economics, New York, New York (via webcast)</p>
